    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Check out My NEWEST Game!</h1><p><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213910/extras/b6c2f94e1570f73cae4abcd112836d74.avif?t=1728827922\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rune it Out is a multiplayer PVP game but you can also play with AI.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, you combine different runes to cast spells that will change the map and turn your friends to dust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A great dwarven Smith was born in a magical world. He was so skilled in smithing that he felt limited by physical means alone. To surpass these limitations, he incorporated magic into his craft and invented a new object called a rune. By combining runes, he developed a new method of casting magic, which he called &quot;Rune Casting.&quot; Soon after, an arena was built where the most skilled &quot;Rune mages&quot; competed for fame and mana. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213910/extras/8ff35e93fd30ef93c378b58e155fe39a.avif?t=1728827922\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer and Singleplayer(AI)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple character choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine Different runes to create amazing spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully Interactive map</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- Progressing Grimoire (Spell Book)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kill other &quot;Rune Mages&quot; to gain their &quot;rune mana&quot; and use it to unlock new spells in a grimoire</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213910/extras/eadae92ab1295102b31b25d408a96d76.avif?t=1728827922\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- Chanting </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Type your spells as fast as you can. Otherwise, your RuneMage also won't chant them fast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213910/extras/2c59e7c79330bb5497b60ae8c99b4e2d.avif?t=1728827922\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Miscasting :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Concentrate on casting your spells. If you don't, you will miscast them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Artefact Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not long after, a new competition the &quot;Artefact Battle&quot; was invented, one in which multiple &quot;Rune Mages&quot; clashed their spells against each other to attain an Artefact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213910/extras/da650fa0e85f3eaab4324b4a9f40b990.avif?t=1728827922\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Clashing spells: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to counter the enemy spells as fast as possible</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Multiplayer PvP </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Mana:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Counter, the spells of your enemies or hit them with your own to acquire mana and Achieve Victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rune it Out is a multiplayer PVP game but you can also play with AI.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, you combine different runes to cast spells that will change the map and turn your friends to dust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A great dwarven Smith was born in a magical world. He was so skilled in smithing that he felt limited by physical means alone. To surpass these limitations, he incorporated magic into his craft and invented a new object called a rune. By combining runes, he developed a new method of casting magic, which he called &quot;Rune Casting.&quot; Soon after, an arena was built where the most skilled &quot;Rune mages&quot; competed for fame and mana. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213910/extras/8ff35e93fd30ef93c378b58e155fe39a.avif?t=1728827922\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer and Singleplayer(AI)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple character choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine Different runes to create amazing spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully Interactive map</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- Progressing Grimoire (Spell Book)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kill other &quot;Rune Mages&quot; to gain their &quot;rune mana&quot; and use it to unlock new spells in a grimoire</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213910/extras/eadae92ab1295102b31b25d408a96d76.avif?t=1728827922\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- Chanting </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Type your spells as fast as you can. Otherwise, your RuneMage also won't chant them fast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213910/extras/2c59e7c79330bb5497b60ae8c99b4e2d.avif?t=1728827922\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Miscasting :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Concentrate on casting your spells. If you don't, you will miscast them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Artefact Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not long after, a new competition the &quot;Artefact Battle&quot; was invented, one in which multiple &quot;Rune Mages&quot; clashed their spells against each other to attain an Artefact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213910/extras/da650fa0e85f3eaab4324b4a9f40b990.avif?t=1728827922\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Clashing spells: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to counter the enemy spells as fast as possible</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Multiplayer PvP </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Mana:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Counter, the spells of your enemies or hit them with your own to acquire mana and Achieve Victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
